, REPAIR AND OPERATING (MRO) PRODUCTS SERVING BUSINESSES AND INSTITUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS EXPANDED ITS LONG-STANDING EDUCATIONAL ASSISTANCE PROGRAM TO INCLUDE PART-TIME TEAM MEMBERS AND HAS PARTNERED WITH NEW INSTITUTIONS TO PROVIDE HIGH-QUALITY DEGREE PROGRAMS, WITH SOME OFFERED AT NO COST. "EMBRACING CURIOSITY IS CORE TO HOW WE OPERATE AS A TEAM AND GRAINGER IS PROUD TO SUPPORT ALL TEAM MEMBERS IN ACHIEVING THEIR EDUCATIONAL AND CAREER GOALS," SAID RANDY TOSCH, VICE PRESIDENT, TALENT FOR GRAINGER.'}{'symbol': 'GWW', 'date': '2023-06-08 10:15:00', 'title': 'GRAINGER NOW PROVIDES TUITION REIMBURSEMENT FOR PART-TIME TEAM MEMBERS', 'text': 'GRAINGER\'S BEST-IN-CLASS EDUCATIONAL ASSISTANCE PROGRAM IS NOW AVAILABLE TO ALL TEAM MEMBERS DAY ONE WITH SOME DEGREES TO SPECIFIC UNIVERSITIES AT NO COST CHICAGO , JUNE 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GRAINGER (NYSE: GWW), THE LEADING BROAD LINE DISTRIBUTOR OF MAINTENANCE, REPAIR AND OPERATING (MRO) PRODUCTS SERVING BUSINESSES AND INSTITUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS EXPANDED ITS LONG-STANDING EDUCATIONAL ASSISTANCE PROGRAM TO INCLUDE PART-TIME TEAM MEMBERS AND HAS PARTNERED WITH NEW INSTITUTIONS TO PROVIDE HIGH-QUALITY DEGREE PROGRAMS, WITH SOME OFFERED AT NO COST. "EMBRACING CURIOSITY IS CORE TO HOW WE OPERATE AS A TEAM AND GRAINGER IS PROUD TO SUPPORT ALL TEAM MEMBERS IN ACHIEVING THEIR EDUCATIONAL AND CAREER GOALS," SAID RANDY TOSCH, VICE PRESIDENT, TALENT FOR GRAINGER.'}